# Local-only, deliberately not in the repository.
#
# These are kept on this machine but not shared: notes that name hosts and
# instance plans, the SQL record of a schema the app already creates for itself
# on boot, and one-off dumps. Nothing here is read at runtime — src/db/schema.js
# is what actually guarantees the tables exist, so a fresh clone still runs.
